{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q1065505","formula":"PbZn₂(AsO₄)₂·2H₂O","hill":"As2H4O10PbZn2","elements":["H","O","Zn","As","Pb"],"composition":{"H":4.0,"O":10.0,"As":2.0,"Pb":1.0,"Zn":2.0},"names":{"en":"Tsumcorite","uk":"Цумкорит"},"descriptions":{"en":"Tsumcorite is a rare hydrated lead arsenate mineral that was discovered in 1971, and reported by Geier, Kautz and Muller. It was named after the TSUMeb CORporation mine at Tsumeb, in Namibia, in recognition of the Corporation's support for mineralogical investigations of the orebody at its Mineral Research Laboratory.","uk":"Цумкорит — це рідкісний гідратований мінерал, арсенат свинцю, який був відкритий у 1971 році та про який повідомили Гейєр, Каутц і Мюллер. Він був названий на честь копальні TSUMeb CORporation в Цумебі (Намібія), на знак визнання підтримки корпорацією мінералогічних досліджень рудного тіла в Лабораторії дослідження мінералів."},"fame":12,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1065505","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsumcorite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A6%D1%83%D0%BC%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tsumcorite-160209.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q3566308","formula":"Zn₃(AsO₄)₂·2H₂O","names":{"en":"Warikahnite"},"elements":["H","O","Zn","As"],"fame":10,"kind":null},{"id":"Q142316","formula":"Zn₂AsO₄(OH)·H₂O","names":{"en":"Legrandite","uk":"Леграндит"},"elements":["H","O","Zn","As"],"fame":16,"kind":"crystal"},{"id"